 the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","table","At"],"ans":"At the table","pt":"Na mesa."},{"words":["flat","In","a","new"],"ans":"In a new flat","pt":"Num apartamento novo."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"plant","pos":"noun","pt":"planta","ex":"A green plant.","expt":"Uma planta verde."},{"w":"soon","pos":"adv","pt":"em breve","ex":"See you soon.","expt":"Até breve."},{"w":"sunlight","pos":"word","pt":"sunlight","ex":"luz do sol","expt":"Lots of sunlight."},{"w":"bookshelf","pos":"word","pt":"bookshelf","ex":"estante","expt":"A tall bookshelf."},{"w":"curtains","pos":"word","pt":"curtains","ex":"cortinas","expt":"Blue curtains."},{"w":"rug","pos":"word","pt":"rug","ex":"tapete","expt":"A soft rug."},{"w":"kitchenette","pos":"word","pt":"kitchenette","ex":"cozinha pequena","expt":"A small kitchenette."},{"w":"heating","pos":"word","pt":"heating","ex":"aquecimento","expt":"Central heating."},{"w":"laundry room","pos":"word","pt":"laundry room","ex":"lavanderia","expt":"A shared laundry room."},{"w":"storage","pos":"word","pt":"storage","ex":"armazenamento","expt":"Extra storage."},{"w":"doorbell","pos":"word","pt":"doorbell","ex":"campainha","expt":"Ring the doorbell."},{"w":"mailbox","pos":"word","pt":"mailbox","ex":"caixa de correio","expt":"Check the mailbox."},{"w":"armchair","pos":"word","pt":"armchair","ex":"poltrona","expt":"A soft armchair."},{"w":"coffee table","pos":"word","pt":"coffee table","ex":"mesa de centro","expt":"A glass coffee table."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**That’s nice!** — Que legal!","**Where do you live now?** — Onde você mora agora?","**In a new flat.** — Num apartamento novo.","**That’s nice! Is it bright?** — Que legal! É claro?","**That’s nice!** — Que legal!","**Come over!** — Venha aqui!","**You’ll love it.** — Você vai adorar."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"show","pt":"mostrar","forms":[["I / you / we / they show","I show my plants."],["he / she / it shows","She shows the flat."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Visiting","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Visiting","lines":[["Tom","Where do you live now?","Onde você mora agora?"],["Eva","In a new flat.","Num apartamento novo."],["Tom","That’s nice! Is it bright?","Que legal! É claro?"],["Eva","Yes, very bright.","Sim, muito claro."],["Tom","Where do you study?","Onde estuda?"],["Eva","At the table.","Na mesa."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: do you (fala rápida)","items":[{"label":"do you (fala rápida)","note":"I am × I’m: Eva fala I’m very happy. Pratique.","words":["I’m happy","I’m in a flat","I’m at home"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say where you live and study.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I live in a flat. I study at the table."},{"q":"React with That’s nice!","pt":"Reaja.","model":"That’s nice!"},{"q":"Say when you work.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I work from home on Friday."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with place + time complements.","model":"I live in a flat. I study at the table every night. I work from home on Friday. My neighbor is very kind. See you soon!","checklist":["Usei **lugar**","Usei **tempo**","Ordem **lugar → tempo**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “plant” mean?","opts":["mesa","planta","limpo"],"ans":1,"why":"**plant** = planta."},{"q":"What does “table” mean?","opts":["claro","frequentemente","mesa"],"ans":2,"why":"**table** = mesa."},{"q":"What does “bright” mean?","opts":["claro","limpo","muito"],"ans":0,"why":"**bright** = claro."},{"q":"What does “clean” mean?","opts":["frequentemente","limpo","em breve"],"ans":1,"why":"**clean** = limpo."},{"q":"Which order is better?","opts":["I study at home every night.","I study every night at home.","At home every night I study."],"ans":0,"why":"lugar → tempo."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["No **Writing**, complementos de lugar e tempo dão detalhe.","No **Reading**, e-mails informais usam *That’s nice!*"]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Faça **tabelas de complementos**.","Treine **lugar → tempo** com cartões.","Erro típico: complemento antes do verbo."]}]}]}